es from the target friendly unit, and grants bonus movement speed and health regen for a short time.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升移动速度，变为%radius%范围型技能，而且使用时总是会作用于军团指挥官。", "en": "Increases movement speed and becomes an %radius% area of effect ability, and always affects Legion Commander when used."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "move_speed", "hp_regen", "radius", "immunity_duration", "immunity_resist", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "applies_strong_dispel", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "legion_commander_moment_of_courage", "name_zh": "军团指挥官·勇气之霎", "name_en": "Moment of Courage", "description_zh": "每当受到攻击达到一定次数，军团指挥官都会对目标立即作出反击，而且此次攻击具有吸血效果。", "description_en": "When attacked a number of times, Legion Commander will counter-attack her target with bonus lifesteal.", "notes_zh": ["只有在攻击他人时受到攻击才会触发带有吸血的反击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["trigger_attacks", "buff_duration", "secondary_attack_damage", "hp_leech_percent", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "lifesteal", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "ember_spirit_searing_chains", "name_zh": "灰烬之灵·炎阳索", "name_en": "Searing Chains", "description_zh": "灰烬之灵释放出火焰绳索来缠绕附近的敌人，将他们困于原地并每秒造成一定伤害。", "description_en": "Ember Spirit unleashes fiery bolas that wrap around nearby enemies, anchoring them in place and dealing damage each second.", "notes_zh": ["将随机选取炘周围的单位作为目标。", "不能作用于减益免疫或隐身单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "radius", "damage_per_second", "tick_interval", "unit_count", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "mobility_lock", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "root", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "emb